# Rust build artifacts
/target

# cargo-fuzz: build output and generated corpora/crashes (keep Cargo.toml,
# Cargo.lock, and fuzz_targets/)
/fuzz/target/
/fuzz/corpus/
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/coverage/

# Profiling outputs (cargo-flamegraph)
flamegraph.svg
perf.data*

# Benchmark harness: the scripts, the methodology note and the promoted
# reference numbers are tracked — they are what makes a quoted figure
# reproducible. Only the timestamped run artifacts are local.
/bench/results/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# The per-week plans and the course spec stay local; the ADRs and RFC notes
# under docs/ do not — the README links to them, and the reasoning they hold is
# the most legible artifact here. Week-1/2-tasks.md predate this rule and are
# already tracked.
/Documentation/Week3-8.md
/Documentation/*-plan.md

# CDK: installed dependencies, compiled TypeScript, and synth output.
/infra/node_modules/
/infra/dist/
/infra/cdk.out/
